<https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#countedAsElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "On a <https://w3id.org/iprok/building#Element> whose work another model also carries: the IFC GlobalId of an element of the model the take-off counted it from — the same work, occupying the same space. Repeatable (a placeholder slab is counted as the planks under it). A literal GlobalId, because that is how BOQ lines and activities scope their elements (<https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#hasIFCScope>). Polymorphic — no rdfs:domain (antipattern #8)." .
